OL,3,ANorwegian teen 'hitman' jailed over UK
OL,4,Amurder plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatland, who had admitted to possession
OL,7,Fof the firearms and ammunition, was
OL,8,Funanimously found guilty of conspiracy
OL,9,Fto murder and sentenced at Woolwich
OL,10,FCrown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
